      note: 'pop=1.03M PPLA Rangpur Div; was REJECTED (Mosque-keyword false positive in aliases.en="Mosque Rangpur"); standard AR Wikipedia translit' },

    { slug: 'nilphamari',  newAr: 'نيلفاماري',     source: 'KEEP',
